@startuml
title System Components & Trust Boundaries

package "Client (Trusted)" {
  component Browser
  component "Crypto Module"
  component "Local Storage\n(IndexedDB)"

  Browser --> "Crypto Module"
  "Crypto Module" --> "Local Storage\n(IndexedDB)"
}

package "Server (Untrusted)" {
  component API
  database Database
}

Browser --> API : HTTPS / WebSocket
API --> Database

note bottom of "Local Storage\n(IndexedDB)"
Stores:
- Encrypted Private Key (always)
- Encrypted Messages
- Public Contact Keys
- Draft Messages (plaintext)
end note

note bottom of Database
Stores:
- Public Keys
- Ciphertexts
- Encrypted Private Key (optional)
end note

note top of API
Server never sees:
- Passphrases
- Plaintext private keys
- Plaintext messages
end note

@enduml
